{"Title":"An Act relative to raising the entrance age of police officers","BillNumber":"S1712","DocketNumber":"SD1972","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:09:12.043"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:09:12.0433333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1712/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. O'Connor, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1712) of Patrick M. O'Connor for legislation to raise the entrance age of police officers.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSection 58A of chapter 31 of the General Laws is hereby amended by striking out, in line 4 the words “position of firefighter or police officer if such person has reached his thirty-second birthday on the date of the entrance examination” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- , position of firefighter if such person has reached his thirty-second birthday and police officer if such person has reached his fortieth birthday on the date of the entrance examination. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}